,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">日本Rapidus启用600mm玻璃基板封装线，力争2027年实现2nm芯片量产</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Rust原生AI Agent聚合工具Superconductor开启Alpha测试</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">软银索尼本田联手成立新公司，获万亿日元支持开发日本国产AI基础模型</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/51c2730fb487da97e2d42cb79f9098d6.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">软银、索尼集团、本田及NEC等日本行业巨头正式成立“日本AI基础模型开发”公司，旨在构建自主知识产权的国产AI生态。该项目已应征日本新能源与产业技术综合开发机构（NEDO）的开发计划，若获选，未来五年将获得高达1万亿日元（约65亿美元）的政府财政支持。新公司将组建约100人的顶尖开发团队，由软银高管担任社长，日本AI独角兽Preferred Networks参与研发。战略目标不仅涵盖文本与语言处理，还将重点进军机器人操控AI领域，旨在将日本在硬件与传感技术领域的传统优势转化为AI时代的竞争力。该举措旨在打破对海外技术的依赖，并将研发成果向全日本企业开放，以降低本土企业的智能化门槛，重塑日本在全球AI竞赛中的地位。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">荣耀发布自研YOYO Claw智能体技术，预制23个子虾并降低50% Token消耗</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/61c7b4e0c569c91d15587a5b7184a6d7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">荣耀在PC新品技术沟通会上正式发布自研YOYO Claw智能体技术，旨在解决AI智能体上手复杂、成本高及隐私风险等痛点。该技术核心亮点在于“出厂即预制”，首批内置5大主虾及23个子虾，用户无需编写代码或适配API即可直接使用。性能方面，通过智能任务执行判断，YOYO Claw相比OpenClaw的Token消耗降低50%，任务成功率从89.5%提升至94.5%。在安全架构上，该技术通过“独立安全虾”实现从应用层到驱动层的多重防护，支持高危操作拦截与敏感行为二次确认。YOYO Claw具备全域记忆与端侧优先特性，支持跨端执行任务，可连接荣耀PC、Pad及第三方OpenClaw。该技术已于3月27日开启封测，未来将扩展至手机端，进一步完善其AI智能体生态布局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">日本Rapidus启用600mm玻璃基板封装线，力争2027年实现2nm芯片量产</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/fa7d464ff0bb21f829b46e0fa3f51c2f.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">日本半导体制造商Rapidus于4月13日正式启用位于北海道千岁市的半导体封装试产线。该产线核心技术在于采用600mm×600mm正方形玻璃基板，使单块基板可生产的中介层数量提升至以往的10倍，旨在显著提升AI芯片生产效率。同时，Rapidus启用了紧邻2nm晶圆厂的分析中心，以实现制造与分析的闭环验证。根据规划，Rapidus目标在2027财年下半年实现2nm制程大规模量产，初期月产能为6000片，后续将提升至25000片。日本经济产业省已于4月11日追加拨款6315亿日元，使其累计获得政府研发支持达2.354万亿日元。Rapidus由丰田、索尼、软银等八家企业联合成立，此次布局旨在通过先进封装与先进制程协同，提升其在全球半导体市场的竞争力。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Rust原生AI Agent聚合工具Superconductor开启Alpha测试</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/8d08d4d37d9003fb67b4618fdbda5762.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">近日，专为代理工程打造的Rust原生应用Superconductor正式开启Alpha测试。该工具完全摒弃Electron框架，采用纯Rust编写并利用Metal GPU加速，实现低于50毫秒的启动速度。Superconductor的核心优势在于其强大的聚合能力，支持在一个统一界面内并行运行Claude Code、Gemini CLI、Cursor Agent等多个主流编码Agent，并允许用户通过无限标签页管理独立工作空间。针对复杂开发场景，该软件内置隔离Git工作树机制，支持实时diff查看、分支管理及PR自动化处理。此外，Superconductor提供高度自定义的布局与快捷键设置，所有数据本地存储，无遥测收集。目前该应用仅支持macOS平台，旨在解决开发者在多Agent切换中的效率瓶颈，通过原生架构实现</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
